+                 f"10/10 rows without noting the vacuous ones; the correct "
+                 f"classification is SCOPED, as the stream itself did for NC5.")
+    print(f"[FV2] {n_vac}/{len(out)} rows VACUOUS -> {verdict}")
+    return verdict
